{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Estimation,_Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Estimation, Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820b8dee5afcd58aacc98547c07f03c058784fa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2\\times 3\\times 4)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"217\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/e/bfe3c0bc0d5b206a4ccbf6c347bfaace7fb000cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the distributive property, this expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/1/d5119467729b6cd7b0d5f03de6df47d1f0346a27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\times 4+2\\times 4+2\\times 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"254\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying the left factor yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/3/123fe99bc9f5c6139eb27cf0d0041762592d4029.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24\\left(\\frac12+\\frac13+\\frac14\\right)= 12 + 8 + 6 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"325\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>-fn106068, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Estimation.2C_Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Estimation,_Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Estimation, Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Estimation, Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c5b73aade53dc69232552fb4e2633e85be4cd5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12+\\frac13+\\frac14 &gt; \\frac12+\\frac14+\\frac14 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"224\" height=\"37\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/a/b2a393968d40a82d65adf94f97ecb4ee7ac5468e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2\\times 3\\times 4)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right) &gt; 2\\times 3\\times 4 \\times 1 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"370\" height=\"45\" />. \n</p><p>The only answer choice greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffe7b389669d4b913e179995e5e340d7acca75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"no